OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain
OL,6,Fgradually easing this evening and
OL,7,Fclearing to the south by dusk.
OL,8,FOvernight will then remain dry with
OL,9,Fclear spells and a few mist patches
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Feeling fresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FMist patches quickly clearing
OL,13,Fto leave a dry and sunny day, with
OL,14,Fsome patchy cloud around at times.
OL,15,FFeeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,16,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
